Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They won again.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.35,0:00:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Sakamoto's amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job, Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.02,0:00:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you beat the top French team!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him in person before.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.87,0:00:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I be on your team, even just as a reserve?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.95,0:00:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's really popular.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.61,0:00:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, of course he is.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.27,0:00:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's the top-ranked player in Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.67,0:00:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's even been featured in gaming magazines.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.74,0:00:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting for someone?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.89,0:00:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.40,0:00:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you waiting for someone?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.24,0:00:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.50,0:00:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm waiting for a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't here yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, want to play with us until they get here?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.70,0:00:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my team logged out, you see.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.43,0:00:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.51,0:01:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no good at this game.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.89,0:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd just slow you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.22,0:01:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll back you up.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.59,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you hitting on her?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't any girls on the internet, man.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.10,0:01:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you two.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.54,0:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}BTOOOM!{\i0} is more fun \Nto play than to watch,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.76,0:01:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.70,0:01:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.63,0:01:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This was how I met Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.11,0:01:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a fateful encounter. {\i0}
