Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.08,0:03:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez Miho, why didn't you come yesterday?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.05,0:03:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Himiko!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.93,0:03:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my brother's friends came over.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.54,0:03:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They hogged the game console.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.56,0:03:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you at least have sent me a text?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.84,0:03:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They made me play with them.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You know {\i1}you'll{\i0} be paying for the snacks now, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.34,0:03:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You really do stand out, Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.65,0:03:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I hate that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it rough, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.19,0:03:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then give it all to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.70,0:03:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hair, eye color, and your boobs!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.17,0:03:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have them!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.00,0:03:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so yesterday...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.59,0:03:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I played {\i1}BTOOOM!{\i0} with Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.98,0:03:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakamoto?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.13,0:03:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The best player in Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.40,0:03:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just three games with his team \Nraised my rank by 20,000.
