Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.86,0:04:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko, why don't you send this photo to that Sakamoto guy?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.47,0:04:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.06,0:04:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.29,0:04:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're actually a busty, blonde high school girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.67,0:04:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound like an old man, Miho!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.89,0:04:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Other than being a foreigner, I was nothing special.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.82,0:04:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just a normal high school girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.71,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd go to school and hang out with friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.63,0:04:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sometimes, I'd play online games.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.72,0:04:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really was just a normal girl...
