Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.79,0:05:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, this is...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.54,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}supposed to be my punishment?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.02,0:05:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.30,0:05:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why is this only happening to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.44,0:05:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are these all bombs?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.76,0:05:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I really supposed to kill people with these?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.20,0:05:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.79,0:05:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.65,0:05:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should I head into the jungle?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.53,0:05:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.53,0:05:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bet there are bugs and snakes!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.83,0:05:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't go in there. My clothes will get dirty!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's hot.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is this island?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish I had some sunscreen.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will I...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.08,0:05:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,956)\i1}ever be able to go back?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.32,0:05:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at this.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.09,0:06:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it yesterday!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.15,0:06:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.28,0:06:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"Is there anyone around that you'd like to be rid of?" { anyone troublesome, not just anyone  Surely the fact that you want them gone implies that they are, in some way, 'troublesome' to you? }
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.42,0:06:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Some new kind of chain letter?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.03,0:06:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You give them a name, and you get 100,000 yen?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.00,0:06:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.87,0:06:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've heard of this.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.06,0:06:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's led to some crazy incidents lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.90,0:06:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it on the news.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.16,0:06:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're saying that people have actually gone missing.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.46,0:06:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it's for real?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.88,0:06:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Then let's name someone whose death wouldn't bother us and get ourselves 100,000 yen!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awful, Arisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.60,0:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.65,0:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.31,0:06:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hang on.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.59,0:06:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.79,0:06:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.94,0:06:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, we aren't your enemies.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.05,0:06:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.60,0:06:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}men.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.95,0:07:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But there's no telling when someone might show up who doesn't feel that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.11,0:07:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you come with us?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.23,0:07:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.88,0:07:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big island.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.56,0:07:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a look from a cliff, and I didn't see signs of anyone living here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.50,0:07:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No nearby islands, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.80,0:07:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to wait for a passing ship.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.26,0:07:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we're stuck here?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.03,0:07:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee we can get back.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.83,0:07:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We might have to do as we're told and play this game.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.08,0:07:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we all need to work together!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.86,0:07:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say weird stuff like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.81,0:07:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even joke about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.66,0:07:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too hot for this.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, hypocrite.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.13,0:07:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by hypocrite?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.13,0:07:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a teacher.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.97,0:08:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend to do what's right, regardless of the situation.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.89,0:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.98,0:08:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,People like that are always the most powerless.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.68,0:08:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerless?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.99,0:08:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a 4th dan in judo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.58,0:08:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.98,0:08:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Judo?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.75,0:08:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no floor mats here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.97,0:08:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And you think judo will help you against one of these?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.42,0:08:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.57,0:08:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You reached for a bomb.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.25,0:08:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That mean you're ready to fight, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.69,0:08:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how long your ideals will last.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.14,0:08:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you still use that bomb?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.95,0:08:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Or will you keep doing the right thing and let me kill you?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.19,0:08:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.53,0:08:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you kill us to save your own life, \Nyou're just a hypocrite.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.92,0:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.46,0:08:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to kill us both now?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.57,0:08:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking about what's "right", is only hypocrisy here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.93,0:08:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Let me go.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.49,0:09:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.99,0:09:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.51,0:09:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.62,0:09:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a joke. A joke.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.84,0:09:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were going to kill you, I would've long ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.84,0:09:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.70,0:09:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't we group up because we intended to work together?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.59,0:09:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's going nuts because \Nwe have these weapons.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.47,0:09:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all put our weapons in one place.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.55,0:09:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll pick a leader to watch over them.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.49,0:09:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If we all pick the leader, we won't have to worry, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.02,0:09:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And how do we know that leader won't get any strange ideas?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.92,0:09:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.09,0:09:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd be the leader?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.31,0:09:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think {\i1}she{\i0} would be a good choice.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.59,0:09:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.83,0:09:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it. Good idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have faith in her as our leader.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's heavy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.31,0:09:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to be rid of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.53,0:10:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.55,0:10:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stun gun, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.76,0:10:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm the leader?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.09,0:10:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I'm weak?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.06,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I'm a woman?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.83,0:10:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But leaving me in charge can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.44,0:10:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.36,0:10:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.99,0:10:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It dropped something.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.04,0:10:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see what that was.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.51,0:10:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.56,0:10:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.58,0:10:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good food, drinks, body soap, and even sunscreen.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunscreen? Where?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.94,0:10:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can we eat some?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.03,0:10:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't, this stuff will spoil fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.65,0:10:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.48,0:10:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.90,0:10:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did the food come from?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.49,0:11:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at how much you're eating.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.17,0:11:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Food's valuable here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.53,0:11:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we divide it fairly and eat it little by little?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.29,0:11:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You just chowed down without a thought.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.25,0:11:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.01,0:11:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the first place...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.17,0:11:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.32,0:11:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll have some quiet.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.35,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.26,0:11:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We get to hang out at my beloved Yoshioka's!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.01,0:11:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're obsessed with him, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.43,0:11:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so nice of you to invite me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.61,0:11:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He lives in the same building as I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.92,0:11:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I said a friend wanted to meet him,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.36,0:12:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so he said to bring them over.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.24,0:12:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He also said that the other band members would be coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.54,0:12:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.49,0:12:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Judgment Flash is gonna be there?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.75,0:12:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They're already here.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.71,0:12:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him! It's really him!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.98,0:12:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.58,0:12:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop by my place.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.85,0:12:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}My beloved Yoshioka, right before me!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go on ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.51,0:12:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.79,0:12:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.52,0:12:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.98,0:12:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.28,0:12:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.65,0:12:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.82,0:12:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our only chance to run.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.60,0:12:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Run?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.10,0:12:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten what happened yesterday?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.43,0:12:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stay with him, we'll be next.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.64,0:12:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.65,0:13:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take all the food and BIMs while we've got the chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.59,0:13:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... a minute.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.25,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.40,0:13:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been walking quite a while, haven't we?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.22,0:13:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to rest a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.47,0:13:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.51,0:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a drink.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.95,0:13:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.43,0:13:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're nice, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.44,0:13:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I definitely felt something.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.17,0:13:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's him.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.42,0:13:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's following us.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.63,0:13:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.42,0:13:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.97,0:13:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you tell?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.99,0:13:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems to have turned into a radar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.23,0:13:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.22,0:13:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.64,0:13:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I just moved my fingers a little and...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.05,0:13:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.91,0:13:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I moved my fingers, and I really saw him.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.87,0:13:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.86,0:13:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.62,0:13:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, just run!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.12,0:14:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If he catches us, he'll kill us!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.46,0:14:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A rope bridge?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.18,0:14:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I weigh too much.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.89,0:14:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd fall right through!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.15,0:14:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take another path.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.23,0:14:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But there aren't any others.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.85,0:14:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.72,0:14:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.20,0:14:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew I was following you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.59,0:14:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How? With the radar.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.62,0:14:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Radar?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.71,0:14:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.80,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He doesn't know about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Th-Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.63,0:14:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He followed us without using his radar?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.57,0:15:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.50,0:15:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't give that back to me, I'll {\i1}take{\i0} it back.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.89,0:15:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Stay away!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.08,0:15:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A bomb?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.48,0:15:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was a bomb?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.07,0:15:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It wasn't like mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.76,0:15:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.70,0:15:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone has different types.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.15,0:15:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The plants are all dying.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.92,0:15:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Some type of defoliant?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.31,0:15:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.66,0:15:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he tracked us through the jungle.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.93,0:15:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, let's stick to the rocks.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.81,0:15:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.35,0:15:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why won't he let go of me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.06,0:15:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of other enemies.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.66,0:16:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Let's look for a hiding place where we can set an ambush
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.41,0:16:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and prepare for the next fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.82,0:16:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.57,0:16:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! We have to fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.84,0:16:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hesitate for even a moment, we'll be killed!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.88,0:16:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're telling me to kill someone?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.33,0:16:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw what he did!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.13,0:16:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kill or be killed.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.04,0:16:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to kill to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I don't want to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.95,0:16:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, unhand me!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.62,0:16:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you?! You'll be killed!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.92,0:16:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will you stay on this island forever?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.99,0:16:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, let go of me!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.89,0:16:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Listen, Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay quiet.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.52,0:16:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.35,0:16:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.32,0:16:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that for?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt, you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.25,0:16:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom was always better at hitting me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.96,0:16:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.71,0:17:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you running?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.64,0:17:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm fat and creepy?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.14,0:17:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm sweaty and stinky?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.31,0:17:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.86,0:17:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a shower the day before yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.15,0:17:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.48,0:17:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.38,0:17:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late, Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.97,0:17:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Yoshioka{-senpai}.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was getting some snacks.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.70,0:17:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.71,0:17:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's here...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.72,0:17:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the one we really wanted, Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.36,0:17:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Arisa...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.26,0:17:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.51,0:18:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.48,0:18:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay quiet.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.36,0:18:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a good time.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.62,0:18:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.74,0:18:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.74,0:18:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Miho!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.92,0:18:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.74,0:18:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Himiko...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.51,0:18:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Miho!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.10,0:18:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko, you bitch.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.13,0:18:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.53,0:18:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.33,0:18:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.97,0:18:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've gotta call the cops.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.77,0:18:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Call Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.44,0:18:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I brought everyone over to\N Yoshioka's and only I escaped.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.27,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The case got a lot of publicity.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.46,0:19:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yoshioka and his band were arrested.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.17,0:19:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And my friends all moved away.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.18,0:19:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.79,0:19:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.94,0:19:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you disappear!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.04,0:19:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, this is... supposed to be my punishment?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.76,0:19:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that it, Miho?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.73,0:19:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rain?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.95,0:19:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.20,0:19:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.75,0:19:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait, and I'll punish you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.93,0:19:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Punish me?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.46,0:19:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.02,0:19:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how to use it now.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.68,0:19:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that when you use the radar, others can see your position.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.40,0:20:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But depending on how you use it, you can also tell where someone is.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.98,0:20:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I was able to find you again.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.69,0:20:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now... How shall I punish you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.98,0:20:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.34,0:20:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heavy!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.29,0:20:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Titties!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.27,0:20:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.62,0:20:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone save me!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.72,0:20:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobody's coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.60,0:20:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I ran.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.99,0:20:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because I betrayed them.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.40,0:20:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You aren't going to resist anymore?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.48,0:20:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means it's okay, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.54,0:20:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The last girl I liked acted that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.63,0:21:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If they don't resist at all, that means it's okay, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.68,0:21:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not fair...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.56,0:21:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After I was done, everyone got mad at me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.92,0:21:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.26,0:21:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's punish...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.17,0:21:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,this naughty girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.85,0:21:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mom...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.71,0:21:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.90,0:21:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What's that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.49,0:21:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd rather die...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.01,0:21:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}than let him rape me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.05,0:21:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll die together!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.42,0:21:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.35,0:21:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's running?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.50,0:21:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to die alone?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.24,0:21:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.91,0:21:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I killed someone,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.85,0:22:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I don't feel guilty.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.09,0:22:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Instead, I'm proud that I protected myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.82,0:22:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't hesitate anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.57,0:22:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Men are scum.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.82,0:22:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All the men on this island are my enemies.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:34.92,0:22:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're scum.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.81,0:22:56.86,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}I hold my breath and close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.81,0:22:56.86,ED-English 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}I hold my breath and close my eyes
